dmenu - dynamic menu
====================

dmenu is an efficient dynamic menu for X.

Requirements
------------
In order to build dmenu you need the Xlib and Xft header files.

Build
-----
Edit `config.mk` to match your local setup if needed.

Build dmenu and stest:

    make

Install globally:

    sudo make clean install

Configuration
-------------
dmenu is configured by editing `config.h` or `config.def.h` and rebuilding.

Running dmenu
-------------
Run dmenu directly:

    dmenu

Run the standard executable launcher:

    dmenu_run

See the man page for details.
